### 1. SPECIFICATION & ARCHITECTURAL PLAN

---

## System Overview

An organization member invitation system that allows organization administrators to invite users via email, with cryptographically secure expiring tokens, role assignment, and full lifecycle management.

---

## Architectural Decomposition

```
invitation-system/
├── src/
│   ├── config/
│   │   ├── database.ts          # Database connection & pool management
│   │   └── email.ts             # Email transport configuration
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── types.ts             # Core domain types & interfaces
│   │   ├── organization.ts      # Organization model
│   │   ├── user.ts              # User model
│   │   ├── invitation.ts        # Invitation model (DB layer)
│   │   └── membership.ts        # Membership model
│   ├── crypto/
│   │   └── token.ts             # Cryptographic token generation & verification
│   ├── services/
│   │   ├── invitation.service.ts    # Core invitation business logic
│   │   ├── email.service.ts         # Email dispatch service
│   │   └── membership.service.ts    # Membership lifecycle service
│   ├── middleware/
│   │   ├── auth.middleware.ts    # JWT authentication & authorization
│   │   ├── rbac.middleware.ts    # Role-based access control
│   │   └── validation.middleware.ts # Request validation
│   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── invitation.routes.ts  # Invitation API endpoints
│   │   └── membership.routes.ts  # Membership API endpoints
│   ├── jobs/
