```

---

#### 1.3 Edge Cases & Security

| Concern | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| XSS via terminal output | xterm.js renders to canvas/DOM safely; raw strings never innerHTML'd |
| Memory leak on unmount | All timeouts/intervals cleared in cleanup; WS explicitly closed |
| Rapid reconnect storm | Exponential backoff capped at 30s + ±2s jitter |
| Buffer overflow | RingBuffer evicts oldest lines; WebGL renderer for large output |
| Search regex DoS | 200ms debounce + try/catch on RegExp construction |
| Terminal resize flicker | ResizeObserver with 50ms debounce |
| WS message ordering | Sequential processing via message queue |
| Multiple tab memory | Per-session RingBuffer, destroyed on tab close |

---

