- React 18.3, TypeScript 5.4 (strict)
- xterm.js 5.3 + `@xterm/addon-fit` + `@xterm/addon-search` + `@xterm/addon-web-links`
- Zustand 4.5 (session state)
- Vite 5.x (bundler)
- Vitest + React Testing Library (tests)

