### 1. SPECIFICATION & ARCHITECTURAL PLAN

---

## Requirements Analysis

**Core Features:**
- Multi-file diff viewer with file tree navigation
- Monaco Editor-based side-by-side diff view
- Syntax highlighting per language (detected from file extension)
- Inline code review comments (threaded, per-line)
- Git diff parsing (unified diff format)

**Edge Cases:**
- Binary files (skip diff rendering, show notice)
- New files (no original content), deleted files (no modified content)
- Very large diffs (virtualized file list, lazy Monaco mount)
- Files with no changes (collapsed by default)
- Conflicting comment threads on same line
- Empty diffs / null states
- Language detection fallback to `plaintext`
- Monaco Editor SSR-safe lazy loading
- Comment persistence (in-memory store with reducer)
- Responsive layout (collapse sidebar on small screens)

**Security Considerations:**
- All user comment input sanitized before render (no `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`)
- No external network calls — all data is prop-driven or in-memory
- XSS prevented by React's default text rendering
- No eval, no dynamic script injection

**Architecture:**

```
src/
├── types/
│   └── diff.ts                   # All shared TypeScript types
├── utils/
│   ├── diffParser.ts             # Parse unified git diff → DiffFile[]
│   ├── languageDetector.ts       # Extension → Monaco language ID
│   └── commentStore.ts           # Comment reducer + actions
├── components/
│   ├── DiffViewer/
│   │   ├── DiffViewer.tsx        # Root orchestrator
│   │   ├── DiffViewer.module.css
│   │   ├── FileTree.tsx          # Left sidebar file list
│   │   ├── FileTree.module.css
│   │   ├── DiffPane.tsx          # Per-file diff pane (Monaco)
│   │   ├── DiffPane.module.css
│   │   ├── CommentThread.tsx     # Inline comment overlay
│   │   ├── CommentThread.module.css
│   │   ├── CommentForm.tsx       # New comment input form
│   │   └── CommentForm.module.css
│   └── icons/
│       └── Icons.tsx             # SVG icon components
├── hooks/
│   ├── useComments.ts            # Comment state hook
│   ├── useMonaco.ts              # Lazy Monaco loader hook
│   └── useResizable.ts           # Sidebar resize hook
├── App.tsx
├── App.module.css
├── main.tsx
├── index.html
├── vite.config.ts
├── tsconfig.json
└── package.json
```

**Data Flow:**
1. `App.tsx` holds raw unified diff string + comment state
2. `diffParser.ts` converts raw diff → `DiffFile[]` with hunks/lines
3. `DiffViewer` renders `FileTree` + active `DiffPane`
4. `DiffPane` initializes Monaco DiffEditor, registers line decorations for comments
5. Click on gutter → `CommentForm` opens → dispatches `ADD_COMMENT`
6. `CommentThread` renders anchored to Monaco line widget

---

## Type System Design

```typescript
DiffLine: { type: 'add'|'remove'|'context'|'no-newline', content, oldLineNo, newLineNo }
DiffHunk: { header, lines: DiffLine[] }
DiffFile: { oldPath, newPath, language, isNew, isDeleted, isBinary, hunks, oldContent, newContent }
Comment: { id, fileId, side: 'left'|'right', lineNo, author, body, createdAt, replies: Reply[] }
CommentState: { comments: Record<fileId, Comment[]> }
```

