---

## Architectural Analysis

### Component Inventory

| Component | AWS Service | Purpose |
|-----------|-------------|---------|
| Container Orchestration | ECS Fargate | Serverless container runtime |
| Load Balancing | ALB (Application Load Balancer) | HTTP/HTTPS ingress, health checks |
| TLS Termination | ACM (Certificate Manager) | SSL/TLS certificates via DNS validation |
| Observability | CloudWatch Logs + Container Insights | Structured log aggregation, metrics |
| Caching Layer | ElastiCache (Redis) | Session state, application cache |
| Networking | VPC, Subnets, Security Groups | Network isolation |
| DNS | Route53 (optional zone lookup) | Domain routing |
| Secrets | SSM Parameter Store / Secrets Manager | Credential injection |
| IAM | Task Execution Role + Task Role | Least-privilege permissions |

### Module Structure

```
terraform/
├── main.tf                    # Root orchestration
├── variables.tf               # Root input variables
├── outputs.tf                 # Root outputs
├── versions.tf                # Provider/Terraform version constraints
├── terraform.tfvars.example   # Reference var file
│
└── modules/
    ├── networking/
    │   ├── main.tf
    │   ├── variables.tf
    │   └── outputs.tf
