### 1. SPECIFICATION & ARCHITECTURAL PLAN

---

## Requirements Analysis

### Core Features
- **Multi-file diff viewer**: Navigate between multiple changed files in a single session
- **Monaco Editor integration**: Leverage `@monaco-editor/react` with `DiffEditor` component for side-by-side and inline modes
- **Syntax highlighting**: Automatic language detection from file extensions
- **Git diff parsing**: Parse unified diff format into structured data
- **Inline code review comments**: Thread-based comments anchored to specific line numbers on either side of the diff

### Edge Cases
- Empty files (one side null/empty)
- Binary files (skip rendering, show placeholder)
- Renamed/moved files
- Very large diffs (virtualization via Monaco's built-in lazy rendering)
- Simultaneous comment threads on same line
- Unresolved vs resolved comments
- Files with no changes (context-only hunks)
- Language detection fallback for unknown extensions
- Comment editing and deletion
- Dark/light theme toggle

### Security Considerations
- All state is client-side only (no network calls in this implementation)
- No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` — Monaco handles its own DOM
- Comment content sanitized via controlled inputs (no raw HTML injection)
- Unique IDs via `crypto.randomUUID()` for comment/thread identity

---

## Architecture

```
src/
├── main.tsx                          # App entry point
├── App.tsx                           # Root component, theme & global state
├── types/
│   └── diff.ts                       # All TypeScript interfaces
├── data/
│   └── mockDiffs.ts                  # Sample git diff data
├── store/
│   └── useDiffStore.ts               # Zustand global state
├── utils/
│   ├── diffParser.ts                 # Parse unified diff → DiffFile[]
│   ├── languageDetector.ts           # Extension → Monaco language ID
│   └── lineMapper.ts                 # Map hunk lines to original positions
├── components/
│   ├── layout/
│   │   ├── AppShell.tsx              # Main layout wrapper
│   │   ├── Sidebar.tsx               # File tree / changed files list
│   │   └── TopBar.tsx                # Title, stats, theme toggle
│   ├── diff/
