## Architecture Overview

**Goal:** Provision a production-grade AWS ECS Fargate cluster with:
- Application Load Balancer (ALB) with SSL termination
- ACM Certificate with DNS validation
- CloudWatch log groups per service
- Redis ElastiCache (cluster mode disabled, multi-AZ)
- Full VPC networking (public/private subnets, NAT gateways)
- IAM roles with least-privilege
- Security groups with strict ingress/egress rules
- Auto-scaling for ECS tasks
- Secrets Manager integration for Redis auth token

