### 1. SPECIFICATION & ARCHITECTURAL PLAN

---

## Requirements Analysis

### Core Features
1. **Real-time terminal output** via WebSocket streaming into xterm.js
2. **Auto-scrolling** with user override (pause on manual scroll, resume on scroll-to-bottom)
3. **Search buffer filtering** with highlight/navigation through matches in the terminal buffer
4. **WebSocket reconnection** with exponential backoff, jitter, and max-retry cap

### Architecture Decomposition

```
src/
├── types/                          # Strict TypeScript interfaces
│   ├── terminal.types.ts
│   └── websocket.types.ts
├── hooks/                          # Custom React hooks
│   ├── useWebSocket.ts             # WS lifecycle + reconnection
│   ├── useTerminal.ts              # xterm.js lifecycle management
│   ├── useAutoScroll.ts            # Auto-scroll state machine
│   └── useTerminalSearch.ts        # Search + highlight logic
├── services/
│   └── WebSocketService.ts         # Low-level WS wrapper
├── components/
│   ├── TerminalViewer/
│   │   ├── TerminalViewer.tsx       # Root orchestrator
│   │   ├── TerminalViewer.module.css
│   │   └── index.ts
│   ├── SearchBar/
│   │   ├── SearchBar.tsx
│   │   ├── SearchBar.module.css
│   │   └── index.ts
│   ├── StatusBar/
│   │   ├── StatusBar.tsx
│   │   ├── StatusBar.module.css
│   │   └── index.ts
│   └── ConnectionIndicator/
│       ├── ConnectionIndicator.tsx
│       ├── ConnectionIndicator.module.css
│       └── index.ts
├── utils/
│   ├── backoff.ts                  # Exponential backoff with jitter
│   ├── sanitize.ts                 # Input sanitization
│   └── logger.ts                   # Structured logger
├── constants/
│   └── terminal.constants.ts
├── App.tsx
├── App.module.css
└── main.tsx
```

### Edge Cases & Security

| Concern | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| WS URL injection | URL validated against allowlist before connection |
| XSS via terminal data | xterm.js handles raw bytes; no innerHTML usage |
| Memory leak (xterm buffer) | `scrollback` capped at 10,000 lines; buffer trimmed |
| Rapid reconnect storm | Exponential backoff (100ms→30s) + max 10 retries |
| Search regex DoS | Search treated as literal string, not regex |
| Component unmount with open WS | Cleanup in useEffect return / AbortController |
| Concurrent search state | Debounced search input (300ms) |
| Unicode/binary data | `allowProposedApi` disabled; pure UTF-8 mode |

### Data Flow

```
WebSocket → WebSocketService → useWebSocket hook
                                    ↓ (raw data string)
                              useTerminal hook → xterm.Terminal.write()
                                    ↓
                              useAutoScroll → terminal.scrollToBottom()
                                    ↓
                              useTerminalSearch → SearchAddon.findNext/findPrevious()
```

### Reconnection State Machine

```
DISCONNECTED → CONNECTING → CONNECTED → DISCONNECTING
       ↑              |          |
       └── RECONNECTING ←────────┘ (on error/close)
              (with backoff)
```

