### 1. SPECIFICATION & ARCHITECTURAL PLAN

---

#### 1.1 Requirements Analysis

**Core Features:**
- Multi-file diff viewer with file tree navigation
- Monaco Editor-powered side-by-side diff (original vs. modified)
- Syntax highlighting per file language
- Inline code review comments (add, edit, resolve, delete)
- Comment threading support
- Keyboard navigation between files and hunks
- Diff statistics (insertions, deletions, unchanged lines)

**Edge Cases:**
- Binary files (detect and show placeholder)
- Empty files (both sides)
- New file (no original)
- Deleted file (no modified)
- Renamed files
- Very large diffs (virtual scrolling via Monaco)
- Files with no diff (unchanged)
- Comments on lines that no longer exist after re-render
- Concurrent comment edits
- Monaco not yet loaded (loading state)

**Security Considerations:**
- All comment content rendered via controlled React state (no dangerouslySetInnerHTML)
- No eval() or dynamic code execution
- XSS-safe comment rendering using textContent patterns
- Monaco sandboxed iframe worker disabled (use same-origin worker)
- Input sanitization on comment text (max length, trim)

